         @param franka_address IP address or hostname of the robot
         :raises NetworkException: if the connection cannot be established
     )pbdoc")
+      // Every gripper call below blocks until the gripper finishes; move() can
+      // hold for ~1s. Without releasing the GIL that stalls the 1 kHz control
+      // thread and the robot aborts with communication_constraints_violation.
       .def("homing", &franka::Gripper::homing, R"pbdoc(
         Perform homing to find maximum width.
 
